    "id": "Semester 3-DBMS-Module 4-5_Algorithm_for_Decomposition_Using_Functional_Dependencies",
    "relPath": "Semester 3/DBMS/Module 4/5_Algorithm_for_Decomposition_Using_Functional_Dependencies.md",
